New: Add IBTK::CartCellDoubleLinearRefine and IBTK::CartCellDoubleLinearCoarsen,
which apply tensor-product linear interpolation and its cell-volume adjoint to
cell-centered data, and the matching PETSc matrices from
IBTK::PETScMatUtilities::constructProlongationOp() for cell-centered data with the
"LINEAR" operator type.
